sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BATCH as SVC-001 Batch Scheduler
    participant CAP001 as CAP-001 API (SVC-001)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus (SVC-102)
    participant CAP004 as CAP-004 (SVC-012)
    participant EXTBUREAU as EXT: Credit Bureau
    participant SVC053 as SVC-053 (Notifications)
    participant PER001 as PER-001 (Personal Customer)

    Note over BATCH,CAP001: PH-083: Automated Review Trigger
    BATCH->>CAP001: Identify accounts with overdraft expiring within 30 days
    CAP001->>CAP001: Create OverdraftReview (ENT-054) status=initiated
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewTriggered EVT-114

    Note over CAP004,EXTBUREAU: PH-084: Credit Bureau Refresh and Behavioural Analysis
    EventBus--)CAP004: EVT-114 consumed — initiate credit assessment
    CAP004->>EXTBUREAU: Credit bureau refresh (Experian/Equifax API)
    EXTBUREAU-->>CAP004: Bureau score=720, no adverse data
    CAP004->>CAP004: Behavioural analysis: 12-month account usage, income stability
    CAP004--)EventBus: publish OverdraftAssessmentCompleted EVT-115 (grade=B, affordability=0.82)

    Note over CAP001: PH-085: Persistent Debt Screening
    EventBus--)CAP001: EVT-115 consumed — update ENT-054 with assessment
    CAP001->>CAP001: Persistent debt screening: interest_paid < principal_repaid over 18m
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish PersistentDebtScreeningCompleted EVT-116 (status=none)

    Note over CAP001: PH-086: Review Decision and Terms Update
    CAP001->>CAP001: Decision: renew at same limit and APR. Update Account overdraft terms.
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftReviewDecided EVT-117 (decision=renew)

    Note over SVC053,PER001: PH-087: Customer Notification
    CAP001--)SVC053: Dispatch renewal notification (push + email + in-app)
    SVC053--)PER001: Push notification: overdraft renewed, no action required
    CAP001--)EventBus: publish OverdraftCustomerNotified EVT-118
